<title>TURKEY: Turkey ups wheat, durum, corn, barley import taxes.</title>
<headline>Turkey ups wheat, durum, corn, barley import taxes.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish government raised the import tax rates for milling wheat, durum wheat, corn and feed barley to 35 percent, 30 percent, 35 percent and 20 percent respectively, the Official Gazette said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The previous tax rate on the imports of the grains was 15 percent.</p>
</text>
